'''Dioramos''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] grants improved attack power, range, health, the [[Barrier Breaker]] ability, and increases knockback and slow chance to 100%. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] further increases health, attack power, attack frequency and gains the [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] target, [[Multi-Hit]] and [[Long Distance]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]].

