*'''[[Strengthen]]''': Adds 5% attack power at 50% health, improves by 5% per level up to 50% (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Freeze]]''': Reduces freeze duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Weaken]]''': Reduces weaken duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)

