==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Archdragon Dioramos was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[Lords of Earth (Removed Combo)|Lords of Earth]].
*Dioramos gained [[Immune to Slow]] in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].
*God-Emperor Dioramos was among the units that were given [[Barrier Breaker]] in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].
*Dioramos is the 3rd most expensive unit in the game at 6,600¢ in Chapter 2. He only loses to [[High Lord Babel (Legend Rare Cat)|High Lord Babel]] at 6,750¢, as well as the  [[:Category:Killer Cats|Killer Cats]], who are tied with 7,500¢.
*Dioramos is probably named after the PlayStation game [https://psxdatacenter.com/games/J/D/SLPS-02797.html Dioramos], which was also made by PONOS.
*His design greatly resembles one of [[wikia:godzilla:Godzilla|Godzilla]]'s greatest enemies: [[wikia:godzilla:Destoroyah|Destoroyah]]. In addition, they both have the ability to shoot energy beams out of their mouths.

